+### Initial Writer viewport
+
+After `Document_Loaded`, send `Action_SetZoom` with
+`Values: { Zoom: 120, ResetView: true }` to show the first paper edge as well
+as the start of the text. `ResetView` is optional and applies only to Writer.
+Ordinary zoom controls should omit it so zooming preserves reading position.
+This replaces delayed `GoToStartOfDoc` / `PageUp` host commands, which move the
+caret but can leave the paper's top margin clipped.
+
 ## Verification order
 
 1. Check `/hosting/discovery` and `/hosting/capabilities`.
